{"id":"ab51daf02675e633","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-finite-prewellorder.md","title":"Finite Strict Prewellordering Frame","display":"df-finite-prewellorder — Finite Strict Prewellordering Frame","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-finite-prewellorder","aliases":["89-df-finite-prewellorder"],"display":"df-finite-prewellorder — Finite Strict Prewellordering Frame","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-finite]]","[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-finite-prewellorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-finite-prewellorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-prewellorder — Finite Strict Prewellordering Frame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cd755e57aea2c47\" href=\"?note=9cd755e57aea2c47\" title=\"89-df-finite\">89-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"437e16026e9e0691\" href=\"?note=437e16026e9e0691\" title=\"89-df-finite-frame-rank\">89-df-finite-frame-rank</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为有限 GL 框架。这里原书的 prewellordering 以其严格部分表示。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\)</span> 为传递逆良基框架谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\)</span> 为有限载体谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreWO}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{PreWO}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(F)\\)</span> 是本条定义的带这两个守卫的框架谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}prewellorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PreWO}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\\n(wRx\\to(wRy\\lor yRx)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}prewellorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PreWO}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\\n(wRx\\to(wRy\\lor yRx)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 13 章，印刷页 166–167；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n原书 Lemma 1：等价于存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:W\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:W\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wRx\">\\(wRx\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(w)&gt;f(x)\">\\(f(w)&gt;f(x)\\)</span>。同层可有多个互不可及世界；因此它不同于严格线性序。可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为有限框架秩，利用显示的比较条件及有限路径证明逆向。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"9cd755e57aea2c47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite-frame-rank","status":"resolved","id":"437e16026e9e0691","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PreWO}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}prewellorder}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PreWO}_{\\mathrm{fin}}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(W)\\land\n\\forall w,x,y\\in W\\\n(wRx\\to(wRy\\lor yRx)).","display":true},{"tex":"f:W\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"wRx","display":false},{"tex":"f(w)>f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1363,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0adb8444eeba120","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-prewellorder]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-prewellorder]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-modal-logics]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-realization]] → [[89-thm-settheoretic-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["c6ab46cd662b1409","9cd755e57aea2c47","437e16026e9e0691"]}